# Release assets (main.js, manifest.json, styles.css) must be byte-identical to
# what CI builds and signs: GitHub artifact attestations are digest-based, so a
# CRLF checkout on Windows would produce a different hash than the attested one.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
